dist/
.DS_Store

# Local Claude Code config, deliberately untracked.
#
# .claude/skills/ may hold symlinks to this repo's own skills (repo-maintenance,
# freshness-check), which makes Claude Code auto-load them for a session started
# here — convenient, and the reason the directory exists at all. Tracking just
# those symlinks was considered on 2026-09-16 and deferred: they sit beside
# files that are machine-local by nature (settings.local.json, .cc-writes/) and
# the marker files a saboteur-ship run writes (.pipeline-active, .plan-approved),
# so ignoring the directory is the simpler rule. The cost is that each clone
# sets the symlinks up by hand:
#
#   mkdir -p .claude/skills
#   ln -s ../../skills/repo-maintenance .claude/skills/repo-maintenance
#   ln -s ../../skills/freshness-check  .claude/skills/freshness-check
.claude/
